<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1999_7457.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unnßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, unnd was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs unnd
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear>, zuovor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>, Fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear>, wyß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innsonnders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. Was
<lb n="4"/>üch von wegen eines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Landtsknechtischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durchzuges</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>uff <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Meiland</placeName> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anngelanget</unclear>, das
<lb n="6"/>haben wir uß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerm</unclear> schryben unnd der bylag mit mehrerm
<lb n="7"/>verstannden. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thuond</unclear> unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verthruwlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgemeinten</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">avis</unclear> gegen üch <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßisch</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedanncken</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> darüber für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißmaln</unclear> anders nit berichten,
<lb n="10"/>dann das glychwol by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Landtmaers</unclear> wyß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sag</unclear> gang-
<lb n="11"/>en, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Graf Carl Ludwig von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sultz</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ald</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßelben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sohn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">et</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/>was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Landtsknechtischen</unclear> kriegsvolcks uff <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-273" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Italien</placeName> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zefüeren</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhabents</unclear> syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelle</unclear>. Wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habent</unclear> aber noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißharo</unclear> deßen
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewüssen</unclear> grund <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>. Wann nun
<lb n="15"/>wir deßhalber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annders</unclear> und wyters Inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erfarung</unclear> bring-
<lb n="16"/>en <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegend</unclear>, sind wir geneigt, üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßelben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alsbald</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverstendigen</unclear>. Mit bitt, Ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellind</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbeschwerdt</unclear> syn,
<lb n="18"/>da Ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> dingen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vererers</unclear> Inn die hand bringen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glyches</unclear> gegen unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinwider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zetund</unclear>, damit dann
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allersyts</unclear> Inn dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> unnd andern deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">baß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">notwenndige</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürsehung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> die gebür <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschafft</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> uff nechst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beuor</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stehnder</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Badischen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jarßrechnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> den sachen mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">übrigen</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Orten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßeren</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obligender</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">notturfft</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear> nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geredt</unclear> unnd gehanndlet werden
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koenne</unclear>, Als wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nu</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zetuond</unclear>, und alles das
<lb n="26"/>Jenige was zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geliebten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vaterlanndts</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>mehrer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sicherheit</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ruowen</unclear> und wolstand <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befündersam</unclear> unnd
<lb n="28"/><origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zürich</origPlace> <origDate when="1616" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1616</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Junii</unclear></origDate>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1999_7458.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>diensteich sin mag füernemmen zehelffen gesinnet sind. Mit hilff
<lb n="30"/>und bystand Gottes, Inn dessen schirm wir unns sambtlich
<lb n="31"/>wol beuelchend. Date <origDate when="1616" resp="#ner">sambstags den ersten Junij a° 1616</origDate>.
<lb n="32"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="33"/>der statt Züerich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1999_7459.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1999_7460.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="34"/>Den frommen, fürsichtigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear>-
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rath</unclear> der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sancktgallen</unclear></orgName>,
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßeren</unclear> innsonders guoten fründ-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> und gethrüwen lieben Eydt-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnoßen</unclear>.
</p>
